{
  "about": "The Sales X-Ray tutorial list, derived from the AC Feature catalogue (scripts/catalogue/feature_seed.json). Each tutorial names the catalogue features it teaches; tests check those ids still exist. Screens come from dev review fixtures (fictional data only). 'native' marks steps that need the real Android phone (ask the orchestrator for the phone slot first). 'batch' 1 renders first.",
